yle="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Purchase commitments primarily include various non-cancelable agreements to purchase content related to our mobile apps and websites, certain cloud computing services and amounts due under certain partnership agreements. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:RecordedUnconditionalPurchaseObligationsTextBlock" id="f-1101" continuedAt="f-1101-1" escape="true">The amounts due for non-cancelable purchase commitments as of December 31, 2025 are as follows (in millions):</ix:nonNumeric></span><ix:continuation id="f-1101-1"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:78.724%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:19.076%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">2026</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-8" decimals="-6" name="us-gaap:RecordedUnconditionalPurchaseObligationDueWithinOneYear" scale="6" id="f-1102">135</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#0000